      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would be funny, and you could likely do some interesting things if this was a feature.\n\nIt would have to be for only dedicated worlds that explicitly has it enabled. Having this enabled by default for all worlds would be a nightmare moderation-wise, since bad people could literally join every instance just to toss a malicious stickers everywhere.\n\nThis would likely be better made as a feature in a world, rather than using the stickers feature for it though.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
