      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Seeing as users can only spawn one sticker at a time, I don't see why this couldn't be a feature. Having the ability to leave a sticker somewhere you're not anymore, before you spawn another one in a new instance doesn't seem like such a bad idea & could have practical uses too (eg having a sticker that says \"went AFK\" to let a friend know, etc). That would be a good alternative to pens in worlds that don't support those.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
